":"rich_text","block_id":"LMCT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86c2d26a-2b74-4c9a-b22c-028937181d73","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"タイミング同じなので実力差たしかにめちゃくちゃわかりやすくなりそう","ts":"1634263820.112200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y5P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faa3d688-9dd4-4766-827d-d57780d2abd2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"お、何人か一気に入社した的な感じなんですね :goodpoem:","ts":"1634263802.111500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iZ43Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8996A6FF-F32E-4279-939C-5671FCA32153","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"10月に参加したメンバーが続々初回プルリクを出してきたので一通りレビューしたのですが、ほんとまぁハッキリと実力差が出ますね","ts":"1634263737.109800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7lS"}]}]
